Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same emergency stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only one car\Ncan still steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Without ABS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:05.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,slam the brakes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:06.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the wheels lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,A sliding\Ntire can't steer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:09.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,so the\Ncar goes straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:11.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,ABS watches\Nhow fast every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:12.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,wheel is turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:14.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,The moment one\Nstarts to lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:15.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,it eases the brake,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:16.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,then squeezes again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,many times a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:19.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the\Ntires keep rolling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:20.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and they can still turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,That buzz in the pedal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:23.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's ABS working.
